 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先说两个词。",
   "spoken": "先说两个词。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.65
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "预言机，是把链外或别的合约里的数据，交给合约使用的机制。",
   "spoken": "预言机，是把链外或别的合约里的数据，交给合约使用的机制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 3.692,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 3.79,
   "speechEnd": 8.135
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "它交出的，通常是价格。",
   "spoken": "它交出的，通常是价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.192,
   "dur": 3.024,
   "speechStart": 9.29,
   "speechEnd": 11.373
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "闪电贷，是借款、使用、还款，都在同一笔交易里完成的贷款。",
   "spoken": "闪电贷，是借款、使用、环款，都在同一笔交易里完成的贷款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 12.436,
   "dur": 6.648,
   "speechStart": 12.534,
   "speechEnd": 18.26
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "交易结束时没有归还，整笔交易回滚，就像什么都没发生。",
   "spoken": "交易结束时没有归环，整笔交易回滚，就像什么都没发生。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.304,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 19.402,
   "speechEnd": 23.699
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "所以出借方没有风险，也不需要抵押。",
   "spoken": "所以出借方没有风险，也不需要抵押。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.756,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 24.854,
   "speechEnd": 27.889
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "这意味着，本金不再是门槛。",
   "spoken": "这意味着，本金不再是门槛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.96,
   "dur": 3.168,
   "speechStart": 29.058,
   "speechEnd": 31.284
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "任何人都能在一笔交易里，借到闪电贷池的全部流动性。",
   "spoken": "任何人都能在一笔交易里，借到闪电贷池的全部流动性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 32.348,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 32.446,
   "speechEnd": 36.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "打个比方。一家当铺，按隔壁菜市场的最新成交价，给黄金估价。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。一家荡铺，按隔壁菜市场的最新成交价，给黄金估价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.296,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 37.394,
   "speechEnd": 43.332
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "你从朋友那里，借来 1 亿。",
   "spoken": "你从朋友那里，借来 1 亿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.404,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 44.502,
   "speechEnd": 46.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "在菜市场用离谱的高价，买下全部黄金。",
   "spoken": "在菜市场用离谱的高价，买下全部黄金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.744,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 47.842,
   "speechEnd": 51.377
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "再拿 1 克黄金去当铺。",
   "spoken": "再拿 1 克黄金去荡铺。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.452,
   "dur": 2.352,
   "speechStart": 52.55,
   "speechEnd": 53.954
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "当铺按刚才的成交价，估值 100 万，借给你 75 万。",
   "spoken": "荡铺按刚才的成交价，估值 100 万，借给你 75 万。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 55.024,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 55.122,
   "speechEnd": 59.205
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "你把黄金卖回菜市场，把 1 亿还给朋友。",
   "spoken": "你把黄金卖回菜市场，把 1 亿环给朋友。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 60.26,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 60.358,
   "speechEnd": 63.262
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "你赚到 75 万，减去买卖的损耗。",
   "spoken": "你赚到 75 万，减去买卖的损耗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 64.32,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 64.418,
   "speechEnd": 67.287
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "当铺手里，只剩 1 克普通价格的黄金。",
   "spoken": "荡铺手里，只剩 1 克普通价格的黄金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 68.356,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 68.454,
   "speechEnd": 71.323
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立：现实中，这几步要好几天。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立：现实中，这几步要好几天。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 72.392,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 72.49,
   "speechEnd": 76.359
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "链上，它们发生在同一个区块的同一笔交易里。没有人来得及反应。",
   "spoken": "链上，它们发生在同一个区块的同一笔交易里。没有人来得及反应。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 77.412,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 77.51,
   "speechEnd": 82.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "那么，一笔交易里，攻击者能改变什么？",
   "spoken": "那么，一笔交易里，攻击者能改变什么？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 83.536,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 83.634,
   "speechEnd": 86.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "他能把任何 AMM 池子的现货价，推到想要的位置，只要付得起滑点。",
   "spoken": "他能把任何 AMM 池子的现货价，推到想要的位置，只要付得起滑点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 88.092,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 88.19,
   "speechEnd": 92.749
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "他能直接往合约里转入资产，改变余额读数。",
   "spoken": "他能直接往合约里转入资产，改变余额读数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 93.808,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 93.906,
   "speechEnd": 97.513
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "他能把这些操作，和对目标协议的调用，任意组合。",
   "spoken": "他能把这些操作，和对目标协议的掉用，任意组合。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 98.564,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 98.662,
   "speechEnd": 102.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "于是有一条规则：一笔交易内可变的读数，都是攻击者的输入参数。",
   "spoken": "于是有一条规则：一笔交易内可变的读数，都是攻击者的输入参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 103.608,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 103.706,
   "speechEnd": 108.372
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "池子的储备比例，可变。按储备算出的 LP 代币价格，可变。",
   "spoken": "池子的储备比例，可变。按储备算出的 LP 代币价格，可变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 109.444,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 109.542,
   "speechEnd": 115.194
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "合约的余额，可变。读余额算出的金库份额价格，可以被捐赠改变。",
   "spoken": "合约的余额，可变。读余额算出的金库份额价格，可以被捐赠改变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
   "start": 116.24,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 116.338,
   "speechEnd": 122.026
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "时间加权平均价，当前区块很难撼动。链下聚合的价格，一笔交易改不动。",
   "spoken": "时间加权平均价，当前区块很难撼动。链下聚合的价格，一笔交易改不动。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-25.mp3",
   "start": 123.084,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 123.182,
   "speechEnd": 129.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-26",
   "text": "但它们会过时，也会撞上上下限。",
   "spoken": "但它们会过时，也会撞上上下限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg2-26.mp3",
